    "ROB_HUNK_JETPACK_NAME": "Experimental Jump Pack",
    "ROB_HUNK_JETPACK_DESC": "An Umbrella-made tool that allows you to boost yourself in any direction by pressing jump while midair.",
    "ROB_HUNK_SURVIVALKIT_NAME": "Emergency Survival Kit",
    "ROB_HUNK_SURVIVALKIT_DESC": "A survival kit that boosts both your ability to rummage for ammo and the effectiveness of your knife.",
    "ROB_HUNK_TRANSCEIVER_NAME": "Worn Transceiver",
    "ROB_HUNK_TRANSCEIVER_DESC": "Calls in a squadmate to help you on your operation.",
